Ripos
=====
Welcome to Ripos -- the Rust interpreted Python Operating System.

The kernel's only binary component is CPython 3.12 (LP64, freestanding).
Everything else runs as Python.

- kern.write()      -> serial console
- kern.tick()       -> uptime in ms
- kern.after()      -> timer callbacks
- kern.on_key()     -> keyboard events
- import json, re, threading, struct, math, datetime, ...  -> stdlib (built-in C modules + initramfs)
- import tk  -> tkinter-style widgets (no Tcl/Tk):  import tkdemo | import tkwindow

M4 gate: Python reads this file via open('/etc/motd').
